 ref=\"Ezek 28:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,28,5)\">Ezek 28:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 28:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,28,7)\">Ezek 28:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 28:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,28,12)\">Ezek 28:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 29:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,29,12)\">Ezek 29:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 29:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,29,17)\">Ezek 29:17</ref> Solomon's wisdom included this with other forms of cleverness and shrewdness <ref ref=\"1Kgs 2:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,2,6)\">1Kgs 2:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 3:28\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(11,3,28)\">1Kgs 3:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:9\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,9)\">1Kgs 5:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,10)\">1Kgs 5:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:14\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,14)\">1Kgs 5:14</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:26\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,26)\">1Kgs 5:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:4\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,4)\">1Kgs 10:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,6)\">1Kgs 10:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:7\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,7)\">1Kgs 10:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,8)\">1Kgs 10:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:23\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,23)\">1Kgs 10:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:24\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,24)\">1Kgs 10:24</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,3)\">2Chr 9:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,5)\">2Chr 9:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:6\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,6)\">2Chr 9:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,7)\">2Chr 9:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:22\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,22)\">2Chr 9:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 1:10\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(14,1,10)\">2Chr 1:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 1:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,1,11)\">2Chr 1:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 1:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,1,12)\">2Chr 1:12</ref> the Messiah is to have <bdbheb>רוּחַ חָכְמָה וּבִינָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 11:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,2)\">Isa 11:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>shrewdness, wisdom</highlight>, <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:22\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,22)\">2Sam 20:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,10)\">1Kgs 5:10</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Jer 9:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,22)\">Jer 9:22</ref> withheld by God from the ostrich <ref ref=\"Job 39:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,39,17)\">Job 39:17</ref> of magicians and prophets <ref ref=\"Isa 47:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,47,10)\">Isa 47:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 1:4\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(27,1,4)\">Dan 1:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 1:17\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(27,1,17)\">Dan 1:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 1:20\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(27,1,20)\">Dan 1:20</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>wisdom, prudence</highlight> in religious affairs <ref ref=\"Deut 4:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,6)\">Deut 4:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 37:30\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(19,37,30)\">Ps 37:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 51:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,8)\">Ps 51:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 90:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"90\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"90\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,90,12)\">Ps 90:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 10:31\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,31)\">Prov 10:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 33:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,6)\">Isa 33:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 8:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,9)\">Jer 8:9</ref> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <highlight>wisdom</highlight>, ethical and religious: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of God, as a divine attribute or energy; his wisdom is in the skies <ref ref=\"Job 38:36\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,36)\">Job 38:36</ref> by it he numbers the clouds <ref ref=\"Job 38:37\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,37)\">Job 38:37</ref> founded the earth <ref ref=\"Prov 3:19\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(20,3,19)\">Prov 3:19</ref> and made all things <ref ref=\"Jer 10:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,12)\">Jer 10:12</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 51:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,15)\">Jer 51:15</ref>, <ref ref=\"Ps 104:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,24)\">Ps 104:24</ref> it is with him <ref ref=\"Job 12:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,12,13)\">Job 12:13</ref> not to be found by the most persevering human search <ref ref=\"Job 28:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,12)\">Job 28:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 28:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,20)\">Job 28:20</ref> he alone knows it <ref ref=\"Job 28:23\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,23)\">Job 28:23</ref> gives it <ref ref=\"Prov 2:6\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(20,2,6)\">Prov 2:6</ref> and shows its secrets <ref ref=\"Job 11:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,11,6)\">Job 11:6</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> the divine wisdom is personified: she was begotten before all things to be the architect and counsellor of God in the creation (<ref ref=\"Prov 8:22-31\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,22)\">Prov 8:22-31</ref>); she builds a palace and spreads a feast for those who will receive her instruction <ref ref=\"Prov 9:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,9,1)\">Prov 9:1</ref> (compare v<ref ref=\"Prov 9:2-5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,9,2)\">Prov 9:2-5</ref>); she teaches in public <ref ref=\"Prov 1:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,20)\">Prov 1:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 8:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,1)\">Prov 8:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 8:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,5)\">Prov 8:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 8:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,11)\">Prov 8:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 8:12\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,12)\">Prov 8:12</ref> (see context); gives her pupils the divine spirit <ref ref=\"Prov 1:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,23)\">Prov 1:23</ref> by her discipline simple become wise, rulers rule wisely, and those seeking her are richly rewarded <ref ref=\"Prov 8:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,14)\">Prov 8:14</ref> (compare v<ref ref=\"Prov 8:1-21\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,1)\">Prov 8:1-21</ref>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> of man: to get wisdom is principal thing <ref ref=\"Prov 4:7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,4,7)\">Prov 4:7</ref> (twice in verse); its fundamental principle is to fear God <ref ref=\"Ps 111:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"111\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"111\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,111,10)\">Ps 111:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 15:33\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,33)\">Prov 15:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 28:18\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,18)\">Job 28:18</ref> (|| <bdbheb>סוּר מֵרַע בִּינָה</bdbheb>); and know <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, the All Holy <ref ref=\"Prov 9:10\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(20,9,10)\">Prov 9:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 30:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,3)\">Prov 30:3</ref> it is of inestimable worth <ref ref=\"Job 28:18\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,18)\">Job 28:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 8:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,11)\">Prov 8:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 16:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,16)\">Prov 16:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 17:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,16)\">Prov 17:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 23:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,23,23)\">Prov 23:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 24:7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,24,7)\">Prov 24:7</ref> beyond the reach of scorners <ref ref=\"Prov 14:6\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,6)\">Prov 14:6</ref> God giveth it to the good <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:26\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,26)\">Eccl 2:26</ref> men are to incline the ear <ref ref=\"Prov 2:2\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(20,2,2)\">Prov 2:2</ref> attend unto wisdom <ref ref=\"Prov 5:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,5,1)\">Prov 5:1</ref> seek <ref ref=\"Eccl 7:25\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(21,7,25)\">Eccl 7:25</ref> know <ref ref=\"Prov 24:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,24,14)\">Prov 24:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 1:17\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(21,1,17)\">Eccl 1:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 8:16\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(21,8,16)\">Eccl 8:16</ref> behold <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:12\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,12)\">Eccl 2:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 9:13\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(21,9,13)\">Eccl 9:13</ref> get her <ref ref=\"Prov 4:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,4,5)\">Prov 4:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 4:7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,4,7)\">Prov 4:7</ref> treat her as sister <ref ref=\"Prov 7:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,7,4)\">Prov 7:4</ref> happy the man who finds her <ref ref=\"Prov 3:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(20,3,13)\">Prov 3:13</ref> he who has wisdom is <bdbheb>אִישׁ תְּבוּנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 10:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,23)\">Prov 10:23</ref> <bdbheb>נָבוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 10:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,13)\">Prov 10:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 14:33\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,33)\">Prov 14:33</ref> <bdbheb>מֵבִין</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 17:24\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,24)\">Prov 17:24</ref> compare also <ref ref=\"Ps 49:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,49,4)\">Ps 49:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 4:21\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,21)\">Job 4:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 12:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,12,2)\">Job 12:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 12:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,12,12)\">Job 12:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 13:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,5)\">Job 13:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 15:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,8)\">Job 15:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 26:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,26,3)\">Job 26:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 32:7\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(18,32,7)\">Job 32:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 32:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,32,13)\">Job 32:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 33:33\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,33)\">Job 33:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 1:2\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,2)\">Prov 1:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 1:7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,7)\">Prov 1:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 2:10\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(20,2,10)\">Prov 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 4:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,4,11)\">Prov 4:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 11:2\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(20,11,2)\">Prov 11:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 13:10\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,10)\">Prov 13:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 14:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,1)\">Prov 14:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 14:8\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,8)\">Prov 14:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 18:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,18,4)\">Prov 18:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 21:30\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,30)\">Prov 21:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 24:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,24,3)\">Prov 24:3</re